:"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOyEjbg","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T22:12:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T22:12:33Z","body":"> For me it lags way before 100k, even if you hide or delete them, it's just text, so isn't there a deeper problem on how it's displayed? I can open a 10milion line document in notepad and it doesn't lag or crash the program.\n\nIdk if you knew this already, but Godot uses its own nodes to make up the GUI of its editor. So I'm pretty sure that nodes are used to represent each error. So like a `HBoxContainer` for each error to organize everything, then two `RichTextLabel`s for each (especially needed for the red font color), and perhaps more code for the collapsing behavior. That means it's not just text, but each object representing it. So that's why it can lag after a while, because there's over 300,000+ objects now. I do think some optimization is possible here, but in general, if you're using a lower-end computer, it still might not work. Therefore limiting the amount of errors might be best. (Would 10,000 be better for you? For me it starts lagging at around 1,000,000 with 16gb of RAM, and I've seen some users have much higher-end hardware than me, so maybe this depends on the hardware)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286994798/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6279007960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122340#issuecomment-6279007960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122340","id":6279007960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdkIO2A","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T22:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T22:45:28Z","body":"I haven't looked into how this is being managed, but it almost certainly is loading the entire log and subsequent UX machinery into memory. The content should only be streamed into the log view for displayed items.\n\nA log cap for expiring old log lines is also appropriate here. Nobody is going to be reading through 100k log lines.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6279007960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]